  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Education Cannot Wait - the global fund for education in emergencies - to support the most marginalised children affected by conflict and crises with protection and access to education. Invest in strategic partnerships that will work alongside ECW to reach more crisis-affected children.</narrative>
